8. Dead Letter Queue (DLQ)

Even after retries:

Plain Text
Retry1 Failed
Retry2 Failed
Retry3 Failed

Move to:

Plain Text
notification-dlq

Flow:

Plain Text
Notification Topic
|
v
Consumer
|
Failure
|
v
Retry 3 times
|
v
DLQ

Operations team can inspect DLQ.

9. Idempotency

Kafka may deliver message more than once.

Need duplicate protection.

Notification event:

JSON
{
"notificationId":"abc123"
}

Before sending:

Java
if(alreadyProcessed(id)) {
return;
}

Database:

SQL
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_notification_id
ON notification_request(notification_id);

Prevents double email/SMS.

10. Rate Limiting

Suppose marketing sends:

Plain Text
